185	  <h1>Glossary: Python/C++ Boundary for Numeric Aggregation</h1>
186	  <p class="subtitle">Key terms for crossing the Python/C++ boundary in time-series numeric aggregation — covering IEEE 754 edge cases, pybind11 type conversion, EIA v2 API ingestion, and the oil-volume metrics (capacity_utilization, days_of_supply, fill_rate) added to this repo.</p>
187	</header>
